 - `respond_within_hours`: 72, 24, 8 or 1, depending on the urgency
 
-Anything the model answers outside these lists is replaced by `general` and `normal`. A ticket with neither subject nor body raises `ValueError`.
+- `fallbacks`: the fields (`queue`, `urgency`, `summary`) for which the model gave no usable answer and a default was used instead
+- `needs_review`: `True` when `fallbacks` is not empty, i.e. the ticket arrived without a real verdict and a person should look at it straight away
