+Anything the model answers outside these lists is replaced by `general` and `normal`, and recorded in `fallbacks`. A missing summary is replaced by the subject, likewise recorded. A ticket with neither subject nor body raises `ValueError`.
 
 Run the tests with `python -m unittest` from this directory.
